"2eo5ahbz8c7":"USB PD lets USB-C deliver up to 240W and negotiates both power and data over the CC line.",
"mt5r8buf44":"Version history: PD 2.0 (2014) introduced Power Rules, PD 3.0 (2015) added PPS and FRS, PD 3.1 (2021) added EPR and AVS, and PD 3.2 was first released in 2023.",
