"os0ln9ozf3":"The most common confusion is how versions map to power levels; see the comparison table below.",
"11cp7ahrld":"USB Power Delivery (PD) is a power delivery standard that lets USB cables and connectors supply up to <span class=\"highlight\">240W (48V/5A)</span> to a wide range of devices. Besides power delivery, USB PD also supports data protocol negotiation over USB-C.",
