"2a6gb96n7ig":"Header Field",
"7jvccm1s08":"Bit Definition &amp; Values",
"udi5tar40v":"The specific message type, which distinguishes Control commands from Data commands.",
"1eokomwvpwg":"<strong>Spec Rev (specification revision)</strong>",
"668agk6vx4":"<code>00b</code>: Revision 1.0 (deprecated; the receiver treats it as 2.0)<br><code>01b</code>: Revision 2.0<br><code>10b</code>: Revision 3.x (shared by 3.0/3.1/3.2)<br><code>11b</code>: Reserved",
"1w2gydt3oju":"<code>0x00</code>: From Device<br><code>0x01</code>: From Cable Plug or VPD",
"1mhqzhj1dq4":"<code>0x00</code>: Sink (power consumer)<br><code>0x01</code>: Source (power provider)",
"1h8fe596or5":"The message number (Message #), used for message counting and duplicate/lost-packet detection.",
"6d85y0w4z9":"The number of data objects included:<br><code>0</code> (Zero): a Control Message<br><code>Non-zero</code>: a Data Message",
"ie5kz25ppo":"<code>0x00</code>: Standard Message<br><code>0x01</code>: Extended Message",
"1slb14u2stz":"Kinds of Data Objects:",
"vfz63etsw2":"<strong>Power Data Object (PDO):</strong> advertises what a Source or Sink can supply or consume.",
"yq848gyuqa":"<strong>Request Data Object (RDO):</strong> the specific power request a Sink sends.",
"o1a09rdecl":"<strong>BIST Data Object (BDO):</strong> a built-in self-test data object.",
"f8ce2sy6y0":"<strong>Vendor Defined Object (VDO):</strong> a vendor-defined object (used for Alt Mode negotiation or reading the E-Marker).",
"1ovkdwq7osy":"<strong>Battery Status Data Object (BSDO):</strong> a battery status data object.",
