"2gnw4s6pfts":"④ The original contract is unchanged",
"9dr29swjyi":"Because an Explicit Contract already existed, the original contract stays after a Reject, and the Sink can later send a different Request. If it were rejected right after connecting, before any Explicit Contract, the Sink would go back to waiting for a new Source_Capabilities and keep using the 5V default supply.",
