"20mi7hyeet8":"No GoodCRC within tReceive (0.9–1.1ms) counts as a failure",
"23z137a7twp":"② No GoodCRC arrives",
"hewn0jxm17":"After sending the message, the Source gets no GoodCRC within tReceive. The cause may be noise corrupting the packet's CRC, or the GoodCRC itself being lost on the way. To the Source the two look the same: the other side did not acknowledge.",
